apache/airflow/pull/72236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/72236.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Add option to parse large config settings from files\r\n---\r\nrelated: #65449\r\ncloses: #70133\r\n\r\nSome config settings e.g. `dag_bundle_config_list` can become quite large for complex Airflow deployments, this PR adds the option to parse these settings from separate files from the filesystem. File config settings are tagged with the `from_file` flag in the config schema. \r\n\r\nFor example, `dag_bundle_config_list` could be set using `dag_bundle_config_list_file=/opt/airflow/dag_config.json` in the config file, or `AIRFLOW__DAG_PROCESSING__DAG_BUNDLE_CONFIG_LIST_FILE=/opt/airflow/dag_config.json` in the environment variables, which would load the json dag bundle config from `/opt/airflow/dag_config.json`. Settings loaded from files also respect the `sensitive: true` flag so the value will be masked where requested, and the path to the file will be returned instead.\r\n\r\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes (please specify the tool below)\r\n- [X] No\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/72236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/72236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":30803401477,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABJdUppM8AAAAHLAabBQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/30803401477","actor":{"login":"ShivanshhhG","id":228652350,"node_id":"U_kgDODaD1Pg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228652350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShivanshhhG","html_url":"https://github.com/ShivanshhhG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShivanshhhG/followers","following_url":"https://api.g